      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        700,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst customer = items[0].json.customer;\nconst lines = items.map(i =>\n  `${i.json.name}  x${i.json.qty}  $${i.json.price} = $${i.json.subtotal}`\n);\nconst total = items.reduce((s, i) => s + i.json.subtotal, 0);\n\nconst receipt = [\n  '╔══════════════════════╗',\n  '║    咖啡廳收據         ║',\n  '╠══════════════════════╣',\n  `║ 客人：${customer}`,\n  '╠──────────────────────╣',\n  ...lines.map(l => `║ ${l}`),\n  '╠──────────────────────╣',\n  `║ 合計：$${total}`,\n  `║ 品項數：${items.length}`,\n  '╚══════════════════════╝'\n].join('\\n');\n\nreturn [{ json: { customer, total, itemCount: items.length, receipt } }];"
      },
      "id": "1de15352-1b19-498d-b3af-c72021d5e380",
      "name": "Code — 彙總收據",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        920,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Demo 3：Data 資料節點\n### 比喻：「印出明細」\n\n**核心概念：** 重塑、拆分、計算、彙總資料\n\n```\n原始訂單 (1筆含陣列)\n   ↓ Split Out\n拆成 3 筆獨立品項\n   ↓ Set\n每筆加上小計 (price × qty)\n   ↓ Code\n彙總成一張收據\n```\n\n**教學重點：** 觀察每個節點的 output 數量變化\n1 → 3 → 3 → 1",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 800,
        "color": 4
      },
